OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors oppose so far
OL,4,Anon-existent tax plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have opposed any potential
OL,7,Ffuture mayoral council tax precept,
OL,8,Fdespite there being "no plans" to
OL,9,Fimpose it.
OL,11,FThe mayoral strategic authority
OL,12,F(NEMSA), is jointly run by the Mayor
OL,13,FKim McGuinness and the leaders of seven
OL,14,Fcouncils, including Sunderland City
OL,15,FCouncil, with several aims including
OL,16,Fimproving infrastructure and creating
OL,17,Fjobs.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
