OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors oppose so far
OL,4,Anon-existent tax plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a council meeting last week in
OL,7,FSunderland, Reform UK, Liberal
OL,8,FDemocrats and Labour councillors all
OL,9,Fbacked a motion entitled "say no to a
OL,10,Fmayoral council tax".
OL,12,FAlthough the mayoral authority has the
OL,13,Flegal power to levy a precept on
OL,14,Fcouncil tax bills, NEMSA said there
OL,15,Fwere no plans for it, adding it "did
OL,16,Fnot understand what has motivated this
OL,17,Fmotion".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
